[Options]
[A.]
<h2>~mThe Rescue</h2>
<br><i>~yIncertum est quo te loco mors exspectat; itaque tu illam omni loco exspecta. 
--Seneka<br></i>
<p>
While you were away, your ally was cought by surprise. He has been fighting an already lost battle. Now he has been captured,
and he waits for you to come and rescue him...
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Let's free him!,DoNothing,0
$Button=Bail,MissionAbort,1

[@10]
<h2>~gA message from your ally:</h2>
<br>Master, help me, I am trapped in this accursed cage! Please help me!! I'm desperate!
$Button=Help is on the way!,DoNothing,0
$Button=Be strong my ally!,Tell,Ally

[Ally]
~gI'll try to hold out till you come master, just please, hurry....
$Button=O.K.,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>~gA message from your ally:</h2>
<br>Thank Nimbus, you've came, master.... And thank you for saving me!<br>
$Button=Anything for a friend!,MssionBegin,LCA	
$ButtoN=Next Mission,MissionBegin,TheGreatBattle
$Button=Finaly...now I may rest,MisSionAbort,1

[Failed]
<h2>~rYou've failed to rescue your ally!</h2>
$Button=Retry Mission,MissonBegin,Resque
$Button=What ever,MissionAbort,1

[End]
